{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"line\": [],\n      \"beads\": [\n        \"B2.1\",\n        \"B2.2\",\n        \"B2.3\",\n        \"B2.4\"\n      ],\n      \"alt\": false,\n      \"note\": \"第4–5小节，歌声尚未浮出，左手的心跳与水浪先把人带入漂浮的等待；船暂时不必靠岸，但水和时间仍在流动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": [\n        \"S02-1\"\n      ],\n      \"beads\": [\n        \"B1.1\",\n        \"B1.2\",\n        \"B1.3\",\n        \"B3.1\",\n        \"B3.2\"\n      ],\n      \"alt\": false,\n      \"note\": \"歌声浮出后，亲近变得可感：两条贴近的歌声像相伴已久的人，周围的空气也温热而潮湿；但歌声虽向高处伸展，声音却收着，话到嘴边又咽回去，显出靠近中的小心与保留。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": [\n        \"S02-1\"\n      ],\n      \"beads\": [\n        \"B4.1\",\n        \"B4.2\",\n        \"B4.3\",\n        \"B3.3\",\n        \"B3.4\"\n      ],\n      \"alt\": false,\n      \"note\": \"柔软的落音让亲近中的欢喜露出一丝惆怅：越喜欢眼前的好，越希望这一刻慢些过去；于是话语仿佛想停又续，却仍不敢惊动这份安静。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": [\n        \"S02-1\"\n      ],\n      \"beads\": [\n        \"B5.1\",\n        \"B5.2\",\n        \"B5.3\",\n        \"B5.5\",\n        \"B5.4\"\n      ],\n      \"alt\": false,\n      \"note\": \"第12–14小节，情绪终于热切地上涌，连呼吸也随之改变；但它没有一路冲向高潮，而是轻轻回落，又略微漂起，仿佛心意虽已靠近，仍没有被彻底说尽。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"explains\": [\n    {\n      \"line\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"beads\": [\n        \"B1\"\n      ],\n      \"why\": \"两条贴近的歌声、无需多言的相伴和温热的身体感，让抽象的等待获得了亲近对象，也使他开始在意自己是否被对方放在心上。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"beads\": [\n        \"B3\"\n      ],\n      \"why\": \"歌声向高处伸展却收弱、话到嘴边又咽回去，以及不愿惊动安静的犹豫，都体现了他虽已靠近，却仍小心保留心意的状态。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"beads\": [\n        \"B4\"\n      ],\n      \"why\": \"甜蜜确认与难以排遣的惆怅，正对应亲近带来的欢喜和酸涩；越珍惜眼前的美好，越希望这一刻不要太快过去。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"beads\": [\n        \"B5\"\n      ],\n      \"why\": \"情绪短暂上涌、呼吸改变，随后又回到柔和而未完全落定的状态，表现了亲近带来的热切与酸涩并存，心意有所流露却仍未彻底说尽。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"unexplained\": [\n    {\n      \"bead\": \"B2\",\n      \"why\": \"心跳、水浪、身体被托举、船上漂浮和时间流动，主要提供等待的身体感、环境意象与时间质感。它们能延续前一段的等待氛围，却不能由S02-1直接解释为何会采用这些具体的船与水的意象。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "14db28bd-e339-4ac6-8e49-0d0c54d743ea", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T084823490391Z", "elapsed_seconds": 104.953, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T08:50:08.446291+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "92346b6213ab10e325f5b4058c07a72f5d0871045d62ad705b1fc8339c0432cc", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T084823490391Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "ef925cbcbecb9b5c5bf0c49a9b84911d4d7c0d035e86888a1c634f77af834062"}}}
